  "question": {
    "text": "A force of 49 N acts tangentially at the highest point of a sphere (solid) of mass 20 kg , kept on a rough horizontal plane. If the sphere rolls without slipping, then the acceleration of the center of the sphere is<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/uTH8D_Z83h8CiFWRcO_CkierX7jy8xmTsarTnYYK_lA.original.fullsize.png\"/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "yB6Uj",
      "text": "$3.5 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "M3Gk4",
      "text": "$0.35 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^2$",
