      "text": "$0.25 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/OtKw8xzirxn5LXuoXjCSrExVpoMQV5yriHik-Kgi7ho.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>Torque about bottom point<br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\mathrm{F} \\times 2 \\mathrm{r}=\\mathrm{I} \\alpha \\\\\n& 49 \\times 2 \\mathrm{r}=\\frac{7}{5} \\mathrm{mr}^2 \\alpha \\\\\n& 14=4 \\mathrm{r} \\alpha<br/>\\end{aligned}$<br/>As sphere rolls without slipping<br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\mathrm{a}=\\mathrm{r} \\alpha \\\\\n& \\mathrm{a}=\\frac{14}{4}=\\frac{7}{2}=3.5 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^2<br/>\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
